          "text": "Reported history and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No trauma or dental work. Possible nocturnal bruxism reported by husband. No headache, visual symptoms, scalp tenderness, jaw claudication, fever, weight loss, PMR symptoms, ear pain, neurological symptoms, or dental pain."
      }
    },
